# Shell scripts must be LF on every platform.
#
# This repository is developed on Windows with core.autocrlf=true, which makes
# the working tree CRLF while the blobs stay LF. For most files that is
# invisible; for a shell script it is fatal — bash reads `set -euo pipefail\r`
# and reports `set: pipefail: invalid option name`, an error that names neither
# the file nor the real cause. A CRLF docker-entrypoint.sh fails the same way at
# container start.
#
# scripts/release-over-ssh.sh is meant to run from a Windows checkout, so this
# is load-bearing rather than cosmetic.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bash text eol=lf
